BTW : Very minor quibble, but I noticed that bats had trouble hitting
me when I was invisible.  Does a cloak of invisibility interfere with
sonar?  In 3.1, we may want to distinguish between those monsters
which would have trouble with invisible foes (most monsters) and those
which would not be fooled (bats, elves, probably some Undead, maybe
some magic-user types).  This would give an added advantage to the
Cloak of Displacement, since it would work against all monsters
equally.
